 # CHANGELOG
 
+## v0.6.2 — 2026-08-21
+
+- Added `BẬT TEST BỘ ĐẾM / DỪNG TEST`: scans nearby strict GMonster records every 500 ms without starting the full dungeon workflow.
+- Added large `ĐÃ GIẾT: x / y` display, seen-alive count, latest just-dead count, total kill and `RESET BỘ ĐẾM`.
+- Reset clears RoleID alive evidence as well as totals so old corpses cannot be counted after reset.
+- Full dungeon start now initializes and refreshes active stage progress immediately as `ĐANG ĐẾM • 0 / requiredKills`.
+- Added deduplicated skip diagnostics for wrong group/filter, outside radius, no prior alive evidence and probable RoleID change.
+- Kept v0.6.1 strict GMonster/live-vitals boundary and all unrelated AUTO/train/trade behavior unchanged.
+- Bumped product/CMake/resource/workflow/artifact identity to v0.6.2.
+
 ## v0.6.1 — 2026-08-20
 - Corrected the v0.6 entity-category error: AutoBuff's nearby `GRole` player scanner is no longer treated as a monster scanner.
 - Dungeon scan now accepts only objects whose runtime class chain contains exact `GMonster`; GRole-only players, NPCs, pets and other sprites are excluded before HP reads and before publication.
