-# PROJECT KNOWLEDGE — v0.6.1 CURRENT
+# PROJECT KNOWLEDGE — v0.6.2 CURRENT
+
+## v0.6.2 counter-test harness
+
+- User-confirmed scope: add only a test harness/visibility layer around the existing dungeon death tracker; do not replace scanner or unrelated AUTO logic.
+- `BẬT TEST BỘ ĐẾM` freezes the selected profile stage/rules and performs `ScanNearbyMonsters` every 500 ms without starting NPC travel, map entry, AutoPath, AutoFight, or exit clicks.
+- `RESET BỘ ĐẾM` intentionally clears all alive evidence; therefore a corpse visible immediately after reset is not a kill until that RoleID is seen alive again.
+- The big counter and stats panel are shared by test mode and full dungeon runtime.
+- Diagnostic skip reasons are logged once per RoleID/reason/session to avoid a 500 ms log flood: wrong group/filter, outside radius, first-seen dead (not seen alive), and probable RoleID change.
+- Full dungeon start initializes `stageKillCounts` and refreshes the list immediately, making the active row `ĐANG ĐẾM • 0 / requiredKills` instead of `-`.
+- v0.6.1 strict GMonster + live-vitals requirements remain unchanged.
 
 ## v0.6.1 strict monster correction
 
