-# Thần Long Item Consolidator v0.6.1
+# Thần Long Item Consolidator v0.6.2
 
-Direct base: v0.6 AUTO PHÓ BẢN. v0.6.1 corrects the entity boundary: the AutoBuff player scanner remains a separate donor, while dungeon scanning accepts only objects whose runtime class chain contains the exact class `GMonster`.
+Direct base: v0.6.1 strict monster scanner. v0.6.2 adds an isolated 500 ms counter-test harness without changing the scanner identity contract: the AutoBuff player scanner remains a separate donor, while dungeon scanning accepts only objects whose runtime class chain contains the exact class `GMonster`.
+
+## v0.6.2 counter test
+
+- `BẬT TEST BỘ ĐẾM / DỪNG TEST` scans the selected dungeon account every 500 ms without starting the full dungeon FSM.
+- The large counter shows `ĐÃ GIẾT: x / y`; the companion status shows seen-alive lives, just-dead events from the latest scan, and total kills.
+- `RESET BỘ ĐẾM` clears kill totals and all prior RoleID alive evidence.
+- Full dungeon runtime now refreshes the first active stage immediately as `ĐANG ĐẾM • 0 / N`.
+- Counter diagnostics are deduplicated per stage/test session and report `sai nhóm/bộ lọc`, `ngoài bán kính`, `chưa thấy sống`, or `đổi RoleID`.
+- A kill still requires the same dynamic RoleID to be observed alive before HP=0/death; first-seen corpses remain fail-closed.
 
 ## AUTO PHÓ BẢN
 
